5,1,1,talk,Rin,,We need a plan that doesn't waste our time! Let's look at the data before we move anything.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We should be mindful of the costs involved in these changes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"We also need to ensure the new layout is fair for everyone, not just a few.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Comfort and noise are often ignored. I want those factors documented this time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,And we shouldn't forget how our seating affects how we talk and learn from each other!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'll check the morning routine upstairs and the badge records to see how we actually arrive.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the floor billing and the facilities quote for the wiring.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I'll take the staff survey plan and the records of unplanned shuffles from last year.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I'll handle the sound meter readings and the physio's notes on workstations.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I'll investigate the project strands from last spring and what the new joiners reported.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
