54,3,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
55,3,1,talk,Rin,,Free Address sounds like a nightmare for my schedule. I'm leaning toward Fixed Desks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Fixed Desks by Function is the most fiscally responsible choice. No recurring facility costs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Rotating Blocks would solve the fairness issue, but the shuffle history makes me hesitate.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Shion,,Rotating is too much physical disruption. Fixed Desks is the only logical choice for comfort.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Yumi,,Fixed Desks by Function perfectly aligns with how we learn and collaborate.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Rin,,I agree. Let's just pick a spot and stay there so we can actually start working.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Toshio,,It avoids the risk of unplanned expenses and budget overruns.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"If the rest of you feel this strongly about stability, I'll concede on the rotation.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Shion,,"Finally, a decision based on the actual physical reality of the office.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Yumi,,It's the best way to keep the team connected.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for Option C.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Toshio,,Option C is my choice.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll go with Option C as well, for the sake of the team's peace.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Shion,,Option C.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"Option C, definitely!","{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
